			"notes": "<img width=\"256\" height=\"135\" alt=\"ProjectilePreview\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/458d1490-058c-4cbe-a124-5235f7c3df81\" />\n\n# Does what the name says\n\nVisualizes projectile trajectories in real time.\n* Accurate physics-based simulation\n* Client-side only\n* Block overlay\n* Mob hitbox\n    * color based on hostile/friendly/neutral\n* works for every throwable and weapon (besides eye of ender)\n\n> Current version: v1.0.1 <br> Current Supported minecraft version: 1.21.2-1.21.11 \n\n\n![Unbenanntes Video – Mit Clipchamp erstellt (2)](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16286ad5-3c3b-43e0-8104-75ba91f80179)"
